 "about_text": "la BEAST gallery is a contemporary art gallery in Los Angeles, founded in April 2022 by Roxana Eslamieh and Zack Christensen. Located at the corner of Cypress and Thorpe Avenues, the gallery's program centers on emerging and mid-career artists, with an emphasis on themes of mythology, naturalism, and the occult. Beyond its exhibition program, la BEAST participates annually in art fairs including NADA New York, NADA Miami, and Felix Art Fair, presenting group and solo showcases of its represented artists.",
